  "abstract": "<jats:p>We introduce a proof-of-concept of a foundry-compatible ferroelectric nematic liquid crystal-on-silicon platform for miniaturized optical modulators. Its operation is based on a dual-mechanism phase shift, negating the need for power-intensive thermo-optic heaters or electrical poling.</jats:p>",
